SUMMARY:ABGESAGT! DELORAINE (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Viper Room
DESCRIPTION: Deloraine haben ihre Tour leider abgesagt.   Mind Over Matter präsentiert Deloraine European Tour 3. November 2026 Viper Room\, Wien Tickets gibt’s ab sofort auf oeticket.com: https://bit.ly/deloraine26 Sowie in allen oeticket.com-Vorverkaufsstellen und europaweit über das Eventim-Vertriebsnetz. ____________________ Deloraine is a pagan fantasy folk band from the Czech Republic whose live performances are full of pagan dances\, mysterious rituals\, and endless energy. Deloraine masterfully blends the powerful vocals of charismatic singers with the rich sound of a wide range of ethnic and exotic instruments. This is more than just a concert – their performance is a ritual and a musical journey through worlds inspired by fantasy\, Celtic mythology\, Norse sagas\, and ancient Slavic legends. Deloraine has released two albums\, Vlaštovka (Swallow Bird) and Srdce z kamene (The Heart of Stone)\, both of which were named album of the week on the biggest Czech music portal musicserver.cz\, and several singles\, including two music videos made for the popular game Witcher 3: Wild Hunt. The single Sabat also won two awards by Celtcast for the best music video and the best song of 2023\, followed up by similar success of the single Odin\, Lord of the Ravens\, which won 3 Celtcast awards. Deloraine performed at festivals like Wave Gotik Treffen (DE)\, Hornerfest (DE)\, Feuertanz (DE)\, Cernunnos fest (FR)\, Echos et Merveilles (FR) Kilkim Zaibu (LT)\, or Trolls&Légendes (BE). The band repeatedly sold out many of their club and open-air shows and regularly appears at major Czech festivals such as Celtic Night\, Lughnasad in Nasavrky\, or various Witcher and fantasy festivals. Deloraine has also performed with contemporary PaganFolk icons such as Heilung\, Faun\, Eivør\, Percival\, Korpiklaani\, Garmarna\, Corvus Corax\, Subway to Sally and many others. Deloraine is currently playing a wide range of events\, from open-air festivals and municipal celebrations to well-attended club events and metal gigs. Even there\, they excel with their acoustic but cutting music. They’ll impress in a short festival set and are just as happy to play a full-length gig because they’re tireless on stage and music is their mission.  
URL:https://www.viper-room.at/events/live-deloraine-support
END:VEVENT
